/E (The E-Commerce Sales and Customer Analytics project successfully transforms raw business data into meaningful and easy-to-understand insights using Power BI. The analysis shows total sales of 2.56M, total profit of 730.34K, and 750 orders, indicating strong overall business performance. Electronics and Home & Kitchen are the leading product categories, while UPI is the most preferred payment method among customers. The sales analysis also highlights variations across months and quarters, with May showing strong monthly performance and Q2 being the strongest quarter. From a regional perspective, the North region generates the highest profit. Overall, the dashboard provides a clear view of sales, customers, products, payment preferences, and regional performance, helping businesses make better and more informed data-driven decisions.)
